      <p begin="00:19.170" end="00:20.670" ttm:agent="v1">First things first rest in peace</p>
      <p begin="00:20.640" end="00:23.180" ttm:agent="v1">Uncle Phil</p>
      <p begin="00:23.180" end="00:24.700" ttm:agent="v1">For real, you the only father</p>
      <p begin="00:24.700" end="00:26.200" ttm:agent="v1">that I ever knew</p>
      <p begin="00:25.870" end="00:27.370" ttm:agent="v1">I get my ***** pregnant</p>
      <p begin="00:26.840" end="00:28.410" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma be a better you</p>
      <p begin="00:28.410" end="00:29.910" ttm:agent="v1">Prophesies</p>
      <p begin="00:28.970" end="00:32.670" ttm:agent="v1">that I made way back in the Ville</p>
      <p begin="00:32.670" end="00:34.210" ttm:agent="v1">Fulfilled, listen even back</p>
      <p begin="00:34.210" end="00:35.710" ttm:agent="v1">when we was broke my team ill</p>
      <p begin="00:35.680" end="00:37.180" ttm:agent="v1">Martin Luther King</p>
      <p begin="00:36.700" end="00:38.200" ttm:agent="v1">would have been on Dreamville</p>
      <p begin="00:38.060" end="00:39.560" ttm:agent="v1">Talk to a *****</p>
      <p begin="00:38.840" end="00:41.640" ttm:agent="v1">One time for my LA sisters</p>
      <p begin="00:41.640" end="00:43.970" ttm:agent="v1">One time for my LA hoes</p>
      <p begin="00:43.970" end="00:46.310" ttm:agent="v1">Lame niggas can't tell the difference</p>
      <p begin="00:46.310" end="00:48.250" ttm:agent="v1">One time for a ***** who knows</p>
      <p begin="00:48.250" end="00:49.750" ttm:agent="v1">Don't save her</p>
      <p begin="00:49.410" end="00:50.910" ttm:agent="v1">She don't wanna be saved</p>
      <p begin="00:50.630" end="00:52.130" ttm:agent="v1">Don't save her</p>
