      <p begin="02:06.970" end="02:09.700" ttm:agent="v1">Out of touch with reality hoes</p>
      <p begin="02:09.700" end="02:11.200" ttm:agent="v1">Out in Hollywood bringin'</p>
      <p begin="02:10.630" end="02:12.130" ttm:agent="v1">back 5 or 6 hoes</p>
